From: Chaos Ruler <zmelumian@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] azahar: run asgard-motiond only while Azahar runs

asgard-motiond (the gyro DSU server, 0016) ran from boot. While it streams the
motion sensors the ADSP wakes ~185 times a second (~10 without it), for a
feature only Azahar uses. Start it with Azahar and stop it when Azahar exits.
---
--- a/projects/ROCKNIX/packages/emulators/standalone/azahar-sa/scripts/start_azahar.sh	2026-10-11 20:17:25.332075544 +0300
+++ b/projects/ROCKNIX/packages/emulators/standalone/azahar-sa/scripts/start_azahar.sh	2026-10-11 20:17:25.339218881 +0300
@@ -100,6 +100,8 @@
 
 # Motion: the Thor's gyro (asgard-motiond, a DSU server on 127.0.0.1:26760) while it runs, else Azahar's own
 # mouse-tilt emulation
+# asgard-motiond runs only while Azahar does (always on, it kept the ADSP sensor core waking ~185 times a second)
+systemctl start asgard-motiond
 if systemctl -q is-active asgard-motiond; then
   sed -i '/^profiles\\1\\motion_device=/c\profiles\\1\\motion_device="engine:cemuhookudp"' ${CONF_FILE}
   sed -i '/^profiles\\1\\motion_device\\default=/c\profiles\\1\\motion_device\\default=false' ${CONF_FILE}
@@ -286,4 +288,5 @@
 fi
 
 ${EMUPERF} /usr/bin/azahar "${1}"
+systemctl stop asgard-motiond
 kill -9 $(pidof gptokeyb)
